rem Sum Square Difference
rem Diff of square-of-sum and sum-of-
rem squares, 1..100

use ranges
use numbers
use io
use cli

rem Inclusive upper boundary.
option Limit integer = 100

Range = 1 to Limit

Sum = Range sum
SquareOfSum = Sum * Sum

Squares = Range * Range
SumOfSquares = Squares sum

Answer = SquareOfSum - SumOfSquares
Answer print
